# Screenshots required for contest submission
# 
# Take at least one screenshot showing:
# - Document requirements list with different status types
# - Examples: Missing (red), OK (green), Expired (red), Not provided (yellow)
# - Should clearly show the status column
#
# To capture:
# 1. Run the app: npm run dev
# 2. Load requirements and upload files
# 3. Navigate to the requirements status table
# 4. Take screenshot (Windows: Win+Shift+S)
# 5. Save here as: status-view.png or similar name
#
# Recommended screenshots:
# - status-view.png (main requirements table)
# - duplicate-detection.png (optional - showing duplicate badge)
# - blocking-issues.png (optional - showing why generate is disabled)
